---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" lang="en">
  <article class="prose mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 pt-10 sm:px-6 dark:prose-invert">
    <h1 class="text-xl font-semibold">About</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      HollyHack is where I document how I learn offensive security: write-ups of retired machines from legal training
      platforms, study notes and short takes on industry news.
    </p>
    <p>
      Every write-up covers a machine that has been officially retired by its platform, so publishing the solution is
      allowed. Posts are available in English and Polish.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Add your contact links here.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
